    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. Just to be 100% sure on the insurance part—since the seller is the one arranging it, what kind of level of coverage are they actually required to provide under the CIF term? Is it just the bare minimum?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
