      "content": "That makes sense. It sounds like a bit of a gap in protection if the buyer isn't careful. Given how easily things can go wrong during sea transit, do you have any advice on how a buyer can mitigate some of those logistical risks if they decide to stick with CIF instead of switching to something like CIP?",
